# fable5-crossmodel — the PRIOR default Fusion harness (Fable 5 + Opus 4.8 + GPT-5.5 era, June 2026).
#
# SUPERSEDED as the live default by fable5-gpt5.6 (July 2026), which drops Opus 4.8 from the panel and
# moves to GPT-5.6. Preserved here, frozen with its original model strings, so the three-model era stays
# one env var away — like opus4.8-era.env. Select it with FUSION_VARIANT=fable5-crossmodel.
#
# Cross-model panel: one Claude Fable 5 + one Claude Opus 4.8 + one GPT-5.5, each answering blind.
# A fresh blind Fable 5 subprocess judges the anonymized answers; the Fable 5 session synthesizes.
#
# Presets assign DEFAULTS (:=), so any var you export explicitly still wins.
: "${FUSION_PANEL:=fable5,opus4.8,gpt5.5}"
: "${FUSION_JUDGE:=fable5}"
: "${FUSION_CLAUDE_MODEL:=claude-fable-5}"
: "${FUSION_OPUS_MODEL:=opus}"
: "${CODEX_PANELIST_MODEL:=gpt-5.5}"
: "${JUDGE_MODEL:=gpt-5.5}"
